HardDiskB5Lean.theorem_1_1 : ∀ (e : HardDiskB5.Lean.Pt),
  ‖e‖ = 1 →
    HardDiskB5.Lean.b5 =
      140 / 81 - 101 * √3 / (9 * Real.pi) + 1169 / (18 * Real.pi ^ 2) - 71 * √3 / (2 * Real.pi ^ 3) +
        (4 *
            ∫ (x : HardDiskB5.Lean.Pt) in HardDiskB5.Lean.disk 0 ∩ HardDiskB5.Lean.disk e,
              (MeasureTheory.volume (HardDiskB5.Lean.disk 0 ∩ HardDiskB5.Lean.disk e ∩ HardDiskB5.Lean.disk x)).toReal ^
                2) /
          Real.pi ^ 3
'HardDiskB5Lean.theorem_1_1' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
